Economic	Feasible: no paid framework, server or database is required.
Operational	Feasible: the desktop-like interface is clear for staff users.
Schedule	Feasible: modules can be implemented and tested independently.
2.4 Comparison
Aspect	Manual Method	Proposed HMS
