CHAPTER 6 - CONCLUSION AND FUTURE SCOPE
6.1 Conclusion
The Hospital Management System successfully demonstrates a complete client-side workflow for essential hospital administration. It brings patient registration, doctor details, appointment scheduling and bill generation into a single browser-based application. The project is easy to run, visually consistent and supported by validation, table updates and confirmation dialogs. 6.2 Future Scope
•	Use a persistent database so records are available after the browser closes.
•	Add secure passwords, user roles and audit logs.
•	Prevent time conflicts when booking appointments.
•	Provide patient history, prescriptions and pharmacy inventory.
•	Generate printable PDF invoices and management reports.
•	Integrate online payment, email/SMS reminders and cloud backup. REFERENCES
